{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:51:58+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T16:51:58+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Jerónimo Martins, SGPS, S.A.","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Food Distribution","country":"Portugal","city":"Lisbon","website":"https://www.jeronimomartins.com","employees":124800,"summary":"Jerónimo Martins, SGPS, S.A. operates in the food distribution sector in Portugal, Poland, Colombia, Slovakia, and internationally. The company operates through Portugal Retail, Portugal Cash & Carry, Poland Retail, Poland Health and Beauty, and Colombia Retail segments. It engages in the operation of chain of food stores under the Biedronka brand; online sales offerings, such as deliveries under the Biek brand, alternative ordering and delivery solutions with e-commerce players, and non-food products through a website; supermarket chains under the Pingo Doce brand; cash and carry stores under the Recheio brand; Bem-Estar parapharmacies and petrol stations; and coffee shops and kiosks under the Jeronymo brand. The company is also involved in the provision of specialized retail of health and beauty products, as well as in-store consultation services under the Hebe brand; operation of a chain of proximity food stores under the Ara brand; and production of dairy, livestock farming, aquaculture, and fruit and vegetables. In addition, it engages in the real estate purchase and sale; sea passenger water transport; renting of air transport equipment; growing of crops and animal farming; saline brackish waters aquaculture; and retail management, consultancy, and logistics. The company was founded in 1792 and is headquartered in Lisbon, Portugal. Jerónimo Martins, SGPS, S.A. operates as a subsidiary of Sociedade Francisco Manuel Dos Santos B.V.","exchange":"Lisbon","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Jernimo Martins, SGPS, S.A. opère dans le secteur de la distribution alimentaire au Portugal, en Pologne, en Colombie, en Slovaquie et à l’international. La société opère à travers les segments Portugal Retail, Portugal Cash & Carry, Poland Retail, Poland Health and Beauty et Colombia Retail. Elle exploite des chaînes de magasins alimentaires sous la marque Biedronka, des offres de vente en ligne, telles que des livraisons sous la marque Biek, des solutions de commande et de livraison alternatives avec des acteurs du commerce électronique et des produits non alimentaires via un site Web, des chaînes de supermarchés sous la marque Pingo Doce, des magasins de caisse et de transport sous la marque Recheio, des parapharmacies et des stations-service Bem-Estar, ainsi que des cafés et des kiosques sous la marque Jeronymo."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":11494063104,"shares_outstanding":628434220,"trailing_pe":18.29,"forward_pe":13.997843,"price_to_book":3.4924576,"ev_to_ebitda":7.927,"ev_to_revenue":0.43,"dividend_yield":0.0359,"payout_ratio":0.64129996,"beta_yahoo":0.494},"targets":{"current_price":18.29,"mean":22.37273,"median":21.75,"high":29.0,"low":15.1,"n_analysts":22,"reco_mean":1.5,"reco_key":"strong_buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-28"],"eps_avg":0.35961,"eps_low":0.30203,"eps_high":0.41,"revenue_avg":10022622000,"ex_dividend":"2026-05-08","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.56183,"institutions_pct":0.23173,"institutions_float_pct":0.52887,"institutions_n":364,"institutions":[{"name":"Generali Investments Cee, Investicni Spolecnost, A.s.","pct":0.0001,"shares":68650,"value":1255608,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0,"shares":3400,"value":62186,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.03}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0064,"shares":4008109,"value":73308317,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.002},{"name":"MFS SERIES TRUST I-MFS Research International Fund","pct":0.006,"shares":3800287,"v